 (a knight) and gains a significant advantage.\n\nReason:  \nCapturing the knight on c3 with the bishop (Bb4-a3) wins a piece and increases Black's lead in development and material. It exploits the lack of protection on c3—White cannot recapture effectively. This move maximizes winning chances early.\n\nAnswer: B: b4-a3"}
